keywords:
  - IMU
  - MEMS
  - accelerometer
  - gyroscope
  - calibration
  - online learning
  - in-sensor computing
  - LSM6DSO16IS
  - Xsens MTi-630
  - time synchronization
abstract: >-
  Synchronized recordings of a low-cost MEMS IMU (STMicroelectronics LSM6DSO16IS) and a high-grade reference IMU
  (Xsens MTi-630) rigidly mounted in the same box: 16 recordings, 262 min, 1.67 million samples at about 106.5 Hz,
  covering cold starts, rest, multi-position, rotations, car driving, walking, stair climbing and a mixed sequence.
  Raw synchronized device outputs and processed data (aligned input, reference and error), with the processing script.
